• Gather, analyze and prioritize user feedback, with a visible feedback loop back to users;

• Drive adoption across development teams through onboarding, documentation, training, demos and success stories;

• Build and support the AI developer community;

• Act as the main interface between business stakeholders, users and technical teams;

• Drive the continuous evolution and adoption of the service;

- Full-remote;

